
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Personal Website</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    background: #080b16;
    color: white;
}

header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 22px 8%;
    background: #101629;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
}

.logo {
    color: #00e5ff;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 20px;
    transition: .3s;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #00e5ff;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 85vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #172c50, #080b16 70%);
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 55px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    animation: appear 1.5s ease;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #00e5ff;
}

.hero p {
    color: #c2c8d6;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 28px;
    background: #00e5ff;
    color: #080b16;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.08);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00e5ff;
}

section {
    padding: 75px 10%;
    text-align: center;
}

h2 {
    color: #00e5ff;
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.about p {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #c2c8d6;
}

.projects {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: #151d31;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00e5ff55;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #00e5ff;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card p {
    color: #c2c8d6;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.contact p {
    margin: 12px;
    color: #c2c8d6;
}

footer {
    background: #101629;
    padding: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #aaa;
}

@keyframes appear {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

@media(max-width: 600px) {
    header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin: 7px;
        font-size: 13px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">MY WEBSITE</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Hello, I'm <span>YOUR NAME</span></h1>
    <p>Welcome to my personal website.</p>
    <a href="#about" class="btn">Discover More</a>
</div>

<section class="about" id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
        Hello! Welcome to my personal website.
        I am passionate about technology, creativity,
        education and discovering new opportunities.
        This is where you can learn more about me
        and explore my projects.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <h2>My Projects</h2>

    <div class="projects">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Project One</h3>
            <p>My first creative project.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Project Two</h3>
            <p>Something amazing I am building.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>My Skills</h3>
            <p>Technology, communication and creativity.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Me</h2>
    <p>Email: your@email.com</p>
    <p>Location: Rwanda</p>
    <a href="mailto:your@email.com" class="btn">
        Send Me an Email
    </a>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 My Personal Website | All Rights Reserved</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
